Package: keenetic-smb-ui
Version: __VERSION__
Depends: libc, samba4-server, samba4-client, cifs-utils
Source: https://github.com/tommilevs/keenetic-smb-ui
SourceName: keenetic-smb-ui
License: AGPL-3.0-or-later
Section: net
URL: https://github.com/tommilevs/keenetic-smb-ui
Maintainer: tommilevs <https://github.com/tommilevs>
Architecture: __ARCH__
Installed-Size: 7200
Description: SMB server manager with a web UI for Keenetic/Entware routers.
 Runs a private Samba instance bound to a dedicated IP, aggregates external
 SMB shares and local disks into one share, and exposes configuration,
 statistics and logs through a built-in web panel.
